# results/ artifact bundle (reports, samples, metrics, docker) — Dropbox-backed
# (박성현/VoxBind/results), NOT git. Only the sync scripts + README travel via git
# so a fresh checkout can bootstrap the pull. Mirrors voxbind/model_zoo.
/results/*
!/results/dropbox_push.sh
!/results/dropbox_pull.sh
!/results/dropbox_pull_baselines.sh
!/results/README.md
# Staged gen/docked poses for the paired interaction figure — ~10 MB of intermediate SDF
# that dock_core_poses.py rebuilds from the exports (at the cost of ~2,100 Vina docks), so
# it rides Dropbox via fig-interaction/dropbox_sync.sh, not git. Same rule as /results.
notebook/html/260910/fig-interaction/poses/
